   * What the app allows, by action: export (Export CSV), select (the checkboxes), bulk (the bulk bar as a whole) and rowActions (the More menu). Each answer is "allow", "disabled", "hidden", true, false or { state, reason }. Hidden removes the control; disabled keeps it focusable with the reason where there is a button, and leaves selection off. Single actions have a permission of their own. This only changes what people see: the server must check again.
